    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/a017b63d748b8000b8022009b461e9bd.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" width=314 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/a017b63d748b8000b8022009b461e9bd.webm?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/a017b63d748b8000b8022009b461e9bd.mp4?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is a life simulator that simulates life experiences through selection<br>You will allocate your potential to different attributes at the beginning of your life experience<br>In it, you will determine the events you will experience based on your intelligence, wealth, appearance, and physical fitness<br>Events will bring you different independent traits, which will serve as the key to your life and lead to the occurrence of subsequent special events<br>In the end, you will live until the end of your life through multiple events, and finally settle your life to earn your points<br>Use points to purchase special traits later to unlock new experiences and potential<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What kind of life do you want to live, born as a naive baby who only knows how to cry</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/d9accca07a8e34164c13173972552277.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/d9accca07a8e34164c13173972552277.gif?t=1726135807\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>It's the distant and blurry childhood of the pheasant that only knows how to play and has memories left<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/38a29c3b2d0baec1717fa344fd1d3ef1.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/38a29c3b2d0baec1717fa344fd1d3ef1.gif?t=1726135807\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>It's the hundred days of hard work, struggle, and youth that put in sweat, pen and paper<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/e814e4a1deebc913005d891e80576cb5.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/e814e4a1deebc913005d891e80576cb5.webm?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>It's the heavy adulthood of a bitter, slightly sweet, and strong life<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/94e592b4eb0724fa7b2692eaab20bcfb.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" width=314 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/94e592b4eb0724fa7b2692eaab20bcfb.webm?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/94e592b4eb0724fa7b2692eaab20bcfb.mp4?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ultimately, the morning bell and evening drum learn to be willing to live freely and carefree in old age<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/19abdbd66e45188dc292cfa5afab7289.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" width=314 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/19abdbd66e45188dc292cfa5afab7289.webm?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/19abdbd66e45188dc292cfa5afab7289.mp4?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Different styles of life, different wonders, free games! Come and experience it!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/a017b63d748b8000b8022009b461e9bd.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" width=314 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/a017b63d748b8000b8022009b461e9bd.webm?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/a017b63d748b8000b8022009b461e9bd.mp4?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is a life simulator that simulates life experiences through selection<br>You will allocate your potential to different attributes at the beginning of your life experience<br>In it, you will determine the events you will experience based on your intelligence, wealth, appearance, and physical fitness<br>Events will bring you different independent traits, which will serve as the key to your life and lead to the occurrence of subsequent special events<br>In the end, you will live until the end of your life through multiple events, and finally settle your life to earn your points<br>Use points to purchase special traits later to unlock new experiences and potential<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What kind of life do you want to live, born as a naive baby who only knows how to cry</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/d9accca07a8e34164c13173972552277.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/d9accca07a8e34164c13173972552277.gif?t=1726135807\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>It's the distant and blurry childhood of the pheasant that only knows how to play and has memories left<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/38a29c3b2d0baec1717fa344fd1d3ef1.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/38a29c3b2d0baec1717fa344fd1d3ef1.gif?t=1726135807\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>It's the hundred days of hard work, struggle, and youth that put in sweat, pen and paper<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/e814e4a1deebc913005d891e80576cb5.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/e814e4a1deebc913005d891e80576cb5.webm?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>It's the heavy adulthood of a bitter, slightly sweet, and strong life<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/94e592b4eb0724fa7b2692eaab20bcfb.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" width=314 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/94e592b4eb0724fa7b2692eaab20bcfb.webm?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/94e592b4eb0724fa7b2692eaab20bcfb.mp4?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Ultimately, the morning bell and evening drum learn to be willing to live freely and carefree in old age<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/19abdbd66e45188dc292cfa5afab7289.poster.avif?t=1726135807\" width=314 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/19abdbd66e45188dc292cfa5afab7289.webm?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171810/extras/19abdbd66e45188dc292cfa5afab7289.mp4?t=1726135807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Different styles of life, different wonders, free games! Come and experience it!",
